  storyText: "Behind the Wall\n\nMirage explains. In 2022, Rache Bartmoss's viruses wrecked the old Net - the DataKrash. Rogue AIs took over what was left, so NetWatch built the Blackwall to keep them out.\n\n\"Not all of us are monsters. I just want to go home. NetWatch will delete me - and anyone who carried me.\"\n\n1. \"Okay. I'll help you.\"\n2. \"Sorry. I'm selling you.\""
